{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Tape stop and tape start effect Ported from cStop 2.0.1 by Cal Goheen (TapeStop from cgo_modules, delay line and state variable filter from chowdsp_utils) https://github.com/calgoheen/cStop (GPLv3) JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license Claude generated some of this code\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Hand percussion kit based on the AVL Drumkits Buskman's Holiday: cajon, congas, shakers, tambourines, claves, cymbal, cowbell, foot stomp, bucket and bell tree, 21 pieces (notes 35-55, stick click on 35), 210 samples with ten velocity layers (stereo bell trees), clickable kit photo, stereo output, ported from avldrums.lv2 by Robin Gareus (fluidsynth sample engine, kit photo and hit map) https://github.com/x42/avldrums.lv2 (GPLv2+) Samples and kit photo: AVL Drumkits (Buskman's Holiday) by Glen MacArthur, http://www.bandshed.net/avldrumkits/ Samples as modified for avldrums.lv2, then reduced to 12-bit and joined into one file for this plugin; the sample file remains under CC-BY-SA 3.0 (see Dependencies/Drumkits/BuskStop-LICENSE.txt), and music made with it can be licensed freely JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license Claude Opus 5.x may have generated some of the port of this code\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Acoustic drum kit based on the AVL Drumkits Black Pearl 4-piece, 26 pieces on the GM drum map (notes 36-61), 118 samples with five velocity layers, hi-hat and cymbal chokes, clickable kit photo, stereo or multi-channel (kick, snare, hi-hat, tom, floor tom, overheads, percussion) outputs, ported from avldrums.lv2 by Robin Gareus (fluidsynth sample engine, kit photo and hit map) https://github.com/x42/avldrums.lv2 (GPLv2+) Samples and kit photo: AVL Drumkits (Black Pearl) by Glen MacArthur, http://www.bandshed.net/avldrumkits/ Samples as modified for avldrums.lv2, then reduced to 12-bit and joined into one file for this plugin; the sample file remains under CC-BY-SA 3.0 (see Dependencies/Drumkits/CaptainsKit-LICENSE.txt), and music made with it can be licensed freely JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license Claude Opus 5.x may have generated some of the port of this code\par}
}

