{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Two-oscillator subtractive polysynth with LFO, filter, distortion and reverb, ported from amsynth by Nick Dowell https://github.com/amsynth/amsynth (GPLv2+) Reverb: Freeverb by Jezar at Dreampoint (public domain) Bundled presets: the 28 banks shipped with amsynth (Factory, BriansBank01-22, PatriksBank01-05) JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license Claude generated some of this code\par}
