{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 DX7-style FM synthesizer, ported from Dexed by Pascal Gauthier https://github.com/asb2m10/dexed (GPLv3) Dexed's synth engine is based on Music Synthesizer for Android by Raph Levien (Google Inc.) https://github.com/google/music-synthesizer-for-android (Apache 2.0) Bundled cartridges: Dexed_01 and SynprezFM_01-32, as shipped with Dexed JSFX version released under GPLv3+ license Claude Code generated some of this code\par}
